fragment-reuses-tab

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Reuse an agent's tab for the same page at another #fragment: opening localhost:4880/components/button#props beside an open localhost:4880/components/button stacked a second tab, because tabs were matched on the whole address.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream matches reopened pages without their fragment.
